OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to house asylum seeker in
OL,4,Aseaside town opposed by council
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to house asylum seekers in
OL,7,Fproperties in a seaside town is being
OL,8,Fopposed by the council.
OL,10,FConwy County Council said it was
OL,11,Fconsulted by the Home Office to
OL,12,Faccommodate 12 asylum seekers in two
OL,13,Fhouses of multiple occupation (HMO) in
OL,14,FLlandudno.
OL,16,FCouncillors said they had been informed
OL,17,Fof the plans but prohibited from
OL,18,Fspeaking on the matter due to the
OL,19,Fsensitive nature of the proposals.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
