OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to house asylum seeker in
OL,4,Aseaside town opposed by council
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokeswoman for the council said it
OL,7,Fwas "committed to providing support to
OL,8,Fpeople seeking sanctuary who have been
OL,9,Fforced to leave their homes due to
OL,10,Fconflict, persecution, violence or
OL,11,Fhumanitarian crises".
